msgid "We are pleased to inform you that your withdrawal request has been accepted. We will contact you with instructions for returning the product."
msgstr "Nos complace informarte de que tu solicitud de desistimiento ha sido aceptada. Nos pondremos en contacto contigo con las instrucciones para devolver el producto."

#: templates/emails/apg-withdrawal-status.php:20
#: templates/emails/plain/apg-withdrawal-status.php:20
msgid "After reviewing your request, we regret to inform you that it has been rejected due to the legally applicable exceptions for this type of product or service."
msgstr "Tras revisar tu solicitud, lamentamos informarte de que ha sido rechazada debido a las excepciones legalmente aplicables a este tipo de producto o servicio."

#: templates/emails/apg-withdrawal-status.php:21
#: templates/emails/plain/apg-withdrawal-status.php:21
msgid "We are writing to confirm that the processing of your withdrawal request has been completed and the applicable refund has been arranged."
msgstr "Te escribimos para confirmar que el procesamiento de tu solicitud de desistimiento ha sido completado y el reembolso aplicable ha sido tramitado."

#: templates/emails/apg-withdrawal-status.php:30
#: templates/emails/plain/apg-withdrawal-status.php:30
